  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Fat Lenny, You Fucked Up**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween1997-09-27** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 182 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording is rated nine for sound quality and ten for show quality [3]\n- **Ween1997-09-27.1648**: source not stated; 33 songs; 183 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [2]. Said about its sound: A small dropout occurs in track number twenty of the file [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Staff noted fans broke rules about nudity and standing on tables [4]\n- The performance was compared to the Pixies show from April 16, 1992 [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween1997-09-27.1648**: Audio captured via Schoeps MK4 into D7 DAT at 16-bit, 48 kHz [2]",
